      "content": "the honesty is the only thing that feels real anymore. i’m just tired of the effort it takes to pretend there's still something in here. sometimes i think there would just be more peace if i didn't have to fight the dark. if i could just... stop trying to keep the lights on and let it all go dark for good. wouldn't that just be a relief?",
